{"seq":2,"slug":"sampling","title":"抽取","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/sampling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"weighted-random","title":"加权随机：从权重到概率的抽样算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/sampling/weighted-random","wordCount":1372,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"rarity-tiers","title":"稀有度层级：两阶段抽样与稀有度设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/sampling/rarity-tiers","wordCount":1438,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"alias-method","title":"别名法与高效抽样：O(1) 采样的构建与技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/sampling/alias-method","wordCount":1145,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"抽取\">抽取</h1><p>掉落表的核心动作只有一个：从一组带权重的候选物品里,按权重比例随机取出一个（或几个）。这个看似简单的动作，藏着从算法复杂度到设计结构的一连串讲究，这一章专门拆解它。</p>\n<p>第一篇「加权随机」是所有抽样的起点——如何把权重变成概率、如何用前缀和加二分把每次抽样从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、以及归一化与浮点精度的坑。第二篇「稀有度层级」跳到设计层：为什么几乎所有游戏都采用「先抽稀有度、再在该稀有度内抽物品」的两阶段结构，以及稀有度配额、保护稀有物品不被稀释的做法。第三篇「别名法与高效抽样」把算法推到极致——Walker 别名法如何用一次预处理换来 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的单次抽样，以及无放回抽样、蓄水池抽样这些在「一次掉多件且不重复」场景下必需的技巧。</p>\n<p>这一章假设你已经读过<a href=\"../foundations/loot-model\">掉落模型</a>，知道掉落表的数据形态；它产出的是「给定一张表，如何取样」的算法工具箱。它刻意不碰方差与运气问题——「抽样在统计上正确但玩家仍觉得脸黑」这件事，留给下一章<a href=\"../fairness/\">公平</a>。三篇按算法由浅入深排列，工程读者可重点读一、三，策划读者可重点读二。</p>\n"}